    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Une journ\u00e9e de la vie du Caf\u00e9 L\u2019Hirondelle, sur une petite place de banlieue, en face d\u2019un cimeti\u00e8re. De l\u2019ouverture \u00e0 6h30 du matin jusqu\u2019\u00e0 la fermeture \u00e0 22h30, les clients entrent, boivent, parlent, sortent, rerentrent, re-boivent et reparlent de plus belle. Ils composent un dr\u00f4le d\u2019op\u00e9ra parl\u00e9, une musique tendre et cocasse, un cantique de pens\u00e9es frapp\u00e9es au coin du plaisir d\u2019\u00eatre ensemble, un verre de vin blanc \u00e0 la main. Le g\u00e9nie populaire danse.",
        "english": "A day at L\u2019Hirondelle caf\u00e9, in a small suburban square, opposite the cemetery. Right from when it opens at 6.30am until it closes at 10.30pm, clients come in, drink, talk, go out, come back, drink and talk some more. They create a curious spoken opera, soft and comical music, a hymn of wild thoughts produced from the pleasure of being together, a glass of white wine in hand."
    },
